    {
      "text": "The table lists common drug–drug interactions of isoniazid and rifamycins by medication class, with example drugs. Arrows show where isoniazid inhibits metabolism and increases blood levels, and where rifamycins accelerate metabolism and decrease blood levels.",
      "lang": "en",
